codex
I found two pre-existing escape hatches in the same adapter: the canonical internal-link vector was bypassed on Windows, and the mode/timestamp vector converted link-creation failures into a skip. Since the hosted runner can create symlinks and the task requires positive-vector consumption, I’m removing both escape hatches and making target-before-link materialization an asserted invariant.
