+- `python -m twine check dist/*ba250bfc4*`: exit 0; wheel and sdist passed.
+- `git diff --check HEAD^..HEAD`: exit 0; `git diff --quiet origin/main...HEAD -- .github`: exit 0; worktree and candidate checkout clean.
